NoncePinPolicy::checkAction
├── given the config was never initialized
│   └── it should fail closed
├── given no settlement is in flight
│   └── it should fail closed
├── given the settlement in flight carries another nonce
│   ├── it should fail
│   └── given the pinned nonce was settled earlier
│       └── it should still fail
└── given the settlement in flight carries the pinned nonce
    ├── it should succeed
    ├── given the pin is zero
    │   └── it should succeed
    ├── given another executor family already settled the pinned nonce
    │   └── it should fail
    ├── given the pinned nonce was spent on Permit2
    │   ├── it should fail
    │   └── given the pin is zero
    │       └── it should fail
    ├── given a Permit2 burn for another account or another nonce
    │   └── it should succeed
    └── given the pin belongs to another multiplexer or another config
        └── it should fail closed
